Subject: [PATCH] CVE-2023-47248: Disable PyExtensionType autoload (Python code only)

Backported from commit f14170976372436ec1d03a724d8d3f3925484ecf
Original commit: GH-38607: [Python] Disable PyExtensionType autoload (#38608)

This security fix disables PyExtensionType autoload (CVE-2023-47248, CWE-502).
NOTE: This patch contains only Python code changes (no documentation).

